1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,170
Listen to a university radio announcement.

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:11,190
Man: Hello students. Our end of semester celebration is next Friday at 6 PM in the student Lounge.

3
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:14,270
It's a great chance to relax before finals week.

4
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:18,220
We'll have food, music, and a few games and activities

5
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:21,190
including trivia and a raffle with small prizes.

6
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:24,334
Faculty from several departments will be there too,

7
00:00:24,334 --> 00:00:29,050
so it's a great opportunity to connect with instructors outside of class.

8
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:33,020
We still need a few volunteers to help set up before the event.

9
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:37,200
If interested, please contact the Student Activities Coordinator by Wednesday.
